{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And he said, Who then</b> — ר\"ת (notarikon): אמו מי — his mother, who — became the broker in this matter, Rebecca." "<b>איפוא</b> — in gematria: גהנם (Gehinnom), for Gehinnom entered with him." "<b>and I will bless him</b> — two (occurrences): one is \"for I have called him one, and I will bless him\"; and the other, regarding Abraham — an allusion to the blessing of Abraham, \"blessed Jacob.\" And it is also written: \"and He will give you the blessing of Abraham.\""], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:13.478076008Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}